{
  "page": 574,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5476,
      "text": "Wahai orang yang berselimut (Muhammad)!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5477,
      "text": "Bangunlah (untuk salat) pada malam hari, kecuali875) sebagian kecil.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5478,
      "text": "(Yaitu) separuhnya atau kurang sedikit dari itu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5479,
      "text": "atau lebih dari (seperdua) itu, dan bacalah Al-Qur`an itu dengan perlahan-lahan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5480,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya Kami akan menurunkan perkataan yang berat kepadamu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5481,
      "text": "Sungguh, bangun malam itu lebih kuat (mengisi jiwa); dan (bacaan di waktu itu) lebih berkesan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5482,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya pada siang hari engkau sangat sibuk dengan urusan-urusan yang panjang.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5483,
      "text": "Dan sebutlah nama Tuhanmu, dan beribadahlah kepada-Nya dengan sepenuh hati.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5484,
      "text": "(Dialah) Tuhan timur dan barat, tidak ada tuhan selain Dia, maka jadikanlah Dia sebagai pelindung.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5485,
      "text": "Dan bersabarlah (Muhammad) terhadap apa yang mereka katakan dan tinggalkanlah mereka dengan cara yang baik.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5486,
      "text": "Dan biarkanlah Aku (yang bertindak) terhadap orang-orang yang mendustakan, yang memiliki segala kenikmatan hidup, dan berilah mereka penangguhan sebentar.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5487,
      "text": "Sungguh, di sisi Kami ada belenggu-belenggu (yang berat) dan neraka yang menyala-nyala,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5488,
      "text": "dan (ada) makanan yang menyumbat di kerongkongan dan azab yang pedih.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5489,
      "text": "(Ingatlah) pada hari (ketika) bumi dan gunung-gunung berguncang keras, dan jadilah gunung-gunung itu seperti onggokan pasir yang dicurahkan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5490,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya Kami telah mengutus seorang Rasul (Muhammad) kepada kamu, yang menjadi saksi terhadapmu, sebagaimana Kami telah mengutus seorang Rasul kepada Fir'aun.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5491,
      "text": "Namun Fir'aun mendurhakai Rasul itu, maka Kami siksa dia dengan siksaan yang berat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5492,
      "text": "Lalu bagaimanakah kamu akan dapat menjaga dirimu jika kamu tetap kafir kepada hari yang menjadikan anak-anak beruban.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5493,
      "text": "Langit terbelah pada hari itu. Janji Allah pasti terlaksana.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5494,
      "text": "Sungguh, ini adalah peringatan. Barangsiapa menghendaki, niscaya dia mengambil jalan (yang lurus) kepada Tuhannya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 73,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُزَّمِّلِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muzzammil",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Enshrouded One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 20,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 574,
      "ruku": 508,
      "hizbQuarter": 229,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
  "language": "id"
}
